   "message": "Not sure what to make of this.\n\nhttps://open.substack.com/pub/postkahanism/p/the-sacrifice-of-the-magical-negro?r=4buhca&utm_medium=ios\n\nstories are powerful - mythic registers and these cycles feel like a very real self-similarity. Another read is subconsciously mediated - are these stories driving us or are we driving them?",
