   "user": "O_oNevermore",
   "message": "ignoring reality and promoting a fraud sets him up for failure\n\nespecially if there is an unspoken lack of an insurance policy when the chickens come home to roost\n\nis it a sacrifice to expose your child to a dangerous environment and abdicate any future responsibility knowing full well something might go wrong?\n\nI think so\n\nso why promote him? why put him in that position?\n\nbecause God is a fat black lesbian these days\n\nand she has a begotten son, who has now paid the price",
